flowchart TD
    DISCONNECT([Room disconnected]) --> CHECK_MEM{_memory_manager exists?}
    CHECK_MEM -- Yes --> GET_CONV[get short_term messages]
    GET_CONV --> END_SESSION[memory_manager.end_session conversation]
    END_SESSION --> SUMMARIZE[Summarize session max 500 tokens]
    SUMMARIZE --> STORE_LTM[Store summary in LongTermMemory Chroma]
    STORE_LTM --> SHUTDOWN_MCP[mcp_manager.shutdown]
    CHECK_MEM -- No --> SHUTDOWN_MCP
    SHUTDOWN_MCP --> LOG([Log session ended])